practitioner of the Adamantine Way|practitioner of the Adamantine Way\nSanskrit: vajrayānika <Word/Term/Phrase>\n\n\nTibetan renderings of vajrayānika: {rdo rje'i theg pa (rnams)/}, {rdo rje theg pa (pa)/}\n\nIt may be of interest to note that although mantrayāna is well attested in Indian sources as a synonym of vajrayāna, a term mantrayānika, which would be perfectly natural as a synonym of vajrayānika, is, as far as can be seen at present, unattested.\n\nSee the full entry at:https://www.itlr.net/hwid:929754
